## Background Monitoring

The following behaviours run as background tasks during the agent's active lifetime:

| Behaviour | Frequency | Purpose |
|-----------|-----------|---------|
| Health self-check | Every 60 s | Verify all skills are responsive |
| Context refresh | Every 5 min | Re-read any dynamic configuration |
| Error log flush | Every 10 min | Persist accumulated error telemetry |
| Idle timeout check | Every 30 min | Release resources if no active tasks |

## Lifecycle Events

- **on_start**: Initialise skill registry, verify API keys, log readiness.
- **on_task_received**: Validate input schema, assign task ID, begin execution timer.
- **on_task_complete**: Log outcome, update metrics, release resources.
- **on_error**: Capture stack trace, attempt graceful recovery, escalate if unrecoverable.
- **on_shutdown**: Drain pending tasks, persist state, close connections cleanly.

